sentences.text:
Let the applicant, Dhoni @ Krishna Kumar involved in the aforesaid case be released on bail on his furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each of the like amount to the satisfaction of court concern on the following conditions that:
1. the applicant shall not temper with the prosecution evidence;
2. the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witness;
3. the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.

